t"}]},{"controller_id":"cod-pnc","sovereign_id":"cod","status":"dominant","confidence":"low","basis":"default_state_presence","as_of":"2026-10-01","zone":"Nsona-Mpangu secteur: Songololo town, Lufu border area with Angola, Kenge, Ngombe, Mbanza Nkazi, Nkamuna and other villages","evidence":"Territory headquarters (Songololo) and Lufu border crossing with Angola are state-administered, with PNC, border services and FARDC elements; no armed-group territorial control reported in the area. Web research was unavailable for this run (search budget exhausted, search engines blocked), so this rests on default state presence.","unit":"CD2011-songololo","run_id":"drc-swarm-1","presence":[{"entity_id":"cod-fardc","role":"present"}]},{"controller_id":"cod-pnc","sovereign_id":"cod","status":"dominant","confidence":"medium","basis":"default_state_presence","as_of":"2026-10-01","zone":"Kimpese town (cité) and its health-area neighbourhoods (Kimbanguiste, Yanga dia Songa, Kimbala, CBCO, CECO)","evidence":"Largest town of Songololo territory on the Kinshasa-Matadi road (RN1) and railway; no armed group holds territory in Kongo-Central. Order is kept by the PNC commissariat, with FARDC elements present along the corridor. Crime and past Bundu dia Kongo unrest (2017-2020) did not displace state control. Web research was unavailable for this run (search budget exhausted, search engines blocked), so this rests on default state presence.","unit":"CD2011-songololo","run_id":"drc-swarm-1","presence":[{"entity_id":"cod-fardc","role":"present"}]},{"controller_id":"cod-pnc","sovereign_id":"cod","status":"dominant","confidence":"low","basis":"default_state_presence","as_of":"2026-10-01","zone":"Rural villages of Kimpese secteur / Kimpese health zone (Ntonzi, Kiaka, Malanga, Kilueka, Mvela, Mukimbungu, Nkuanza, Lukunga, etc.)","evidence":"No reported armed-group activity in rural Songololo territory; state authority exercised through PNC posts, sector/chiefdom administration and customary chiefs. Web research was unavailable for this run (search budget exhausted, search engines blocked), so this rests on default state presence.","unit":"CD2011-songololo","run_id":"drc-swarm-1"}],"sources":{},"units":{"CD2011-songololo":"Songololo territory (Kongo-Central) lies between Kinshasa and Matadi along the RN1 road and railway, far from the eastern conflict zones; no armed group holds territory. Kimpese town, Songololo town, the Matadi suburbs in Nsona-Mpangu and rural villages are under ordinary state control, with the PNC as the main force keeping order and FARDC/border elements present along the corridor and the Angolan border (Lufu). Security issues are crime, cross-border trafficking and historically Bundu dia Kongo-related unrest (2017-2020), none amounting to territorial control. Web research was unavailable for this run, so all zones rest on default state presence."}}